  "contentval": "0001Czzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fNz5/74",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">오늘은 용수철을 직렬연결 혹은 병렬연결해서<br>변화하는 탄성계수 k값이 역학적 에너지에 반영이 될지 실험을 구상해보았습니다!<br><br>기존 탄성계수 k =  K라고 하면<br>병렬 연결한 탄성계수 k = 2K<br>직렬 연결한 탄성계수 k = 0.5K가 됩니다.<br><br>아래 수식에 반영이 될지<br>(k값이 변하면 역학적 에너지에 반영이 될지!)<br>초음파 센서로 측정한 운동 분석으로 알아 보려고 합니다. 처음 진폭은 5cm로 동일하게 실험했습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2c2f5a4df8666b271b90384804ecd7b44e6b022d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2c2f5a4df8666b271b90384804ecd7b44e6b022d\" data-origin-width=\"637\" data-origin-height=\"272\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f3725b1fed9946d2306ebc6ce16cf42ebf8d0b38\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f3725b1fed9946d2306ebc6ce16cf42ebf8d0b38\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"1759\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이거는 기존 탄성계수 k =  K라고 할 때</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3df376620f67e9a2f79e37ecaa5994f88a92d894\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3df376620f67e9a2f79e37ecaa5994f88a92d894\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">밑에 초음파 센서도 달고!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/21d92ad57b185faf7d8b974fc0416544f29d6afd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/21d92ad57b185faf7d8b974fc0416544f29d6afd\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b497cb3fc44205957b866702b9c2a29af7f3c7d7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b497cb3fc44205957b866702b9c2a29af7f3c7d7\" data-origin-width=\"961\" data-origin-height=\"1295\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>이제 이거는 병렬 연결한 탄성계수 k = 2K</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7aa778c9340e5571d122904f1ac524eadd7e8aef\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7aa778c9340e5571d122904f1ac524eadd7e8aef\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">두 겹다니까 용수철이 통통해졌네요</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9b4a0b56946aee49c1da3a12b231b35aceb27da8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9b4a0b56946aee49c1da3a12b231b35aceb27da8\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/43fed3003f50cf4b6d608be3967828548a774e0f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/43fed3003f50cf4b6d608be3967828548a774e0f\" data-origin-width=\"961\" data-origin-height=\"1295\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br><br>마지막으로 직렬 연결한 탄성계수 k = 0.5K가 됩니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/189fe530b1cc2cf0212107c17e17cfb155cfc87f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/189fe530b1cc2cf0212107c17e17cfb155cfc87f\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/56e061d6b34e267e12913e828b3d1bd3208a7085\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/56e061d6b34e267e12913e828b3d1bd3208a7085\" data-origin-width=\"961\" data-origin-height=\"1295\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>이 상태에서 진폭 5cm로 초기에 5번 왕복 운동한<br>실험 데이터를 활용해서 분석해보려 합니다!<br>(아무래도, 5번 더 넘어가면 위 아래 운동 뿐만 아니라,<br>양 옆으로도 움직이고+공기저항으로 감쇄진동의 영향도 있어서 그렇게 했습니다)<br><br>(+)이거는 교육과정 밖이긴 하지만<br>탄성계수 k값에 따라 주기도 바뀌니 그걸<br>그래프로 보는 것도 좋을 것 같습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a9325a4e5c7093a79e422115112eb399b9b56a45\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a9325a4e5c7093a79e422115112eb399b9b56a45\" data-origin-width=\"830\" data-origin-height=\"531\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6a1dccd43b03049274c7758466a9a4ec0dab7c4c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6a1dccd43b03049274c7758466a9a4ec0dab7c4c\" data-origin-width=\"833\" data-origin-height=\"450\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">분석하고 올게용~~!!!<br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그\" data-og-description=\"영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다\" data-og-host=\"m.blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/AYXXM/dJMb9kmeoPe/eEYSy3RdDcTkBgIXuMQqb0/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/AYXXM/dJMb9kmeoPe/eEYSy3RdDcTkBgIXuMQqb0/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그</p><p class=\"og-desc\">영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다</p><p class=\"og-host\">m.blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
